{"rows":[{"cols":[{"designInfo":{"stencilSuperIds":["Output"],"stencilId":"cloud-output"},"label":"Configuration complete","value":"<p>The DataXray operating-model setup has finished. Summary:</p><ul><li><b>Created:</b> {{configureCreatedCount}} new element(s)</li><li><b>Already present:</b> {{configureSkippedCount}} element(s) left untouched</li><li><b>Failed:</b> {{configureFailedCount}} step(s)</li></ul><p>{{configureDetail}}</p><p><b>Run access:</b> the search &amp; sync workflows can now be run by the <b>DataXray User</b> or <b>DataXray Admin</b> role; setup is restricted to <b>DataXray Admin</b> / Sysadmin. Assign users to these roles in <i>Settings &rarr; Roles</i>. If any workflow shows as &ldquo;not deployed yet&rdquo; above, deploy it and re-run this workflow.</p><p><b>Next step:</b> a <b>DataXray Admin</b> or Sysadmin must open each of the Sync DataXray Classifications, Sync DataXray Classification (Nightly) and Search DataXray workflows' settings pages and set the DataXray Base URL and Bearer token (the only two settings each one needs). Full per-step detail is in <code>dgc.log</code>. Click <b>Send</b> to close this workflow.</p>","defaultValue":false,"size":12,"ignore":false,"visible":true,"enabled":true,"isRequired":false,"id":"configureResultsSummary","type":"htmlComponent"}]},{"cols":[{"designInfo":{"stencilSuperIds":["Output"],"stencilId":"cloud-output"},"label":"","value":"<p style=\"color:#888;font-size:smaller\">{{dxrVersionLabel}}</p>","defaultValue":false,"size":12,"ignore":false,"visible":true,"enabled":true,"isRequired":false,"id":"dxrVersionFooter","type":"htmlComponent"}]}],"metadata":{"key":"configureResultsForm","name":"Configuration Results","description":"Displays what the DataXray operating-model bootstrap created, skipped and configured.","version":"1","modelType":"form","flowableDesignVersion":3110,"palette":"flowable-core-form-palette"}}
